su text "chinese-character-link:65e3cb3f84c6" ob text "{\"character\":\"均\",\"targetId\":\"grammar:universal_quantifier_:wi\",\"pya\":\"wi\",\"components\":[\"universal_quantifier_\"],\"english\":\"all\",\"relation\":\"same-sense\",\"confidence\":\"high\",\"status\":\"accepted\",\"source\":\"chinese-character-grammar-refinery\",\"sources\":[\"Project Gutenberg eBook 4094 Analects witness\",\"Project Gutenberg eBook 23839 Analects witness\",\"UD Chinese-GSDSimp @ b79a1c2f7ba7f9b264808d91c6886a67b7f847a3\"],\"rationale\":\"The UD Chinese-GSDSimp data explicitly tags '均' as an ADV (adverb) in contexts indicating distribution or universality (e.g., '均有', '均须'), which aligns with the target definition 'all'. The Analects context ('不患不均') supports the semantic field of equality/uniformity, reinforcing the universal quant/\"}" ya
